rooms_desc ({"You are standing in front of Smorlok's House. It's not small, you can't see theroof. The entrance is to the north.","You are standing in the hall of the House of Smorlok. There are stairs leading up and to the north is a large but strange room.","You are in my private chamber .... leave quickly or die.","The cold walls of the dungeon are splattered heavily with blood here, whichseems to be rather fresh.  On the southern wall a skeleton hangs from a hookimbedded through the back of it's skull.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","You stand on a narrow trail that descends to the north, vanishing intoswirling mist. Strange sounds seem to eminate from that direction. To thesouth the trail just worms it's way between the trees. The air is thick withthe smell of pine and spruce.","Your are in a deep ravine running north and south. The walls are steep andsmooth and you could not scale them even if you wanted to. The ravine pathis worn into the rock and littered with pebbles and other lose debris that hasfallen over the years.","You are in Smorlok's pool room. You can see a large 20 feet deep pool.You can smell the tasty pool water and you might jump in.","You see nothing.Someone thinks :*) I'M NOT HERE ....... SO STOP LOCATING ME !!!","-++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-|                                                            ||   DDDDDD                   III                 EEEEEEEE    ||   DDD  DD                  III                 EEEEEEEE    ||   DDD   DD                 III                 EEE         ||   DDD   DD                 III                 EEE         ||   DDD   DD                 III                 EEEEEEEE    ||   DDD   DD                 III                 EEEEEEEE    ||   DDD   DD                 III                 EEE         ||   DDD   DD                 III                 EEE         ||   DDD  DD                  III                 EEEEEEEE    ||   DDDDDD                   III                 EEEEEEEE    ||                                                            |-++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-",})
